<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1680_6135.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Magnifiques</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">puissants</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">et</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">honores</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seigneurs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">treschers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">amys</unclear>
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">et</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bons</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">voysins</unclear>. Nous avons delivre au present porteur
<lb n="3"/>les septante cinq escus <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">restants</unclear>. selon vostre quittance. La pre-
<lb n="4"/>sente sera pour vous prier nous avoir en favorable recomman-
<lb n="5"/>dation comme vos bien affectionnes. Et par contre nous
<lb n="6"/>prierons Dieu vous donner
<lb n="7"/>Magnifiques et <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">puissants</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seigneurs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">treschers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">amys</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">et</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bons</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">voysins</unclear> tout bon heur et <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">contentement</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">De</unclear> <origPlace resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Geneve</unclear></origPlace>
<lb n="9"/><origDate when="1610" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ce</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">xj</unclear>. may. 1610</origDate>.
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vos</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bien</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">affectionnes</unclear> a vous servir
<lb n="11"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Les <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syndiques</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">et</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">conseil</unclear> de Geneve</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1680_6136.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1680_6137.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="12"/>Edle, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eherenveßte</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrende</unclear> Herrn, liebe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>unnd gute Nachbauren. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Tragern</unclear> diß haben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Uber</unclear>-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">antworttet</unclear>, die restierenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fünff</unclear> unnd sibenzig Cronen,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laut</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eürer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">quitanz</unclear>.
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ferner</unclear> durch diß unnßer schreiben, euch bitten ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gunstigklichen</unclear> wolt für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevolhen</unclear> haben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwre</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgeneigte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gute</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>, da wir dann hin-
<lb n="19"/>gegen Gott bitten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> er euch gebe:
<lb n="20"/>Wolgeachte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eherenveßte</unclear> Herrn, liebe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="21"/>gute Nachbauren, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ieden</unclear> guten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolstandt</unclear> unnd
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> euch gefellig ist.
<lb n="23"/>In <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-169" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Genff</origPlace> <origDate when="1610" resp="#ner">den 11 tag <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Meyen</unclear> Ao 1610</origDate>.
<lb n="24"/>Euch Zedienen, Euwer gantz
<lb n="25"/>Geneigte.
<lb n="26"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Sindicus unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rath</unclear> zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Genff</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1680_6138.jpg" n="4"/>
